- header: read_int(w): skip_ws consumes '\n' → line 2; peek '1'; token "1"; ... etc. Actually the header is "P3\n1 1\n255\n". After magic, the remaining get area is "\n1 1\n255\n". read_int(w): skip_ws consumes '\n', peek '1', token "1" (stops at ' '). from_chars → 1. w=1. read_int(h): skip_ws consumes ' ', peek '1', token "1" (stops at '\n'). h=1. read_int(m): skip_ws consumes '\n', peek '2', token "255" (stops at '\n'). m=255. Then reserve(1).
